---
// Shown on every page until the site is launched: the content is still being reviewed
// by rabbanim. Remove the <ReviewBanner /> lines from the pages when that is done.
---

<p class="review-banner" role="note">
  <span class="rb-he">האתר עדיין בבדיקה של רבנים ואינו סופי. אין לסמוך עליו למעשה בלי לשאול רב. <a href="/questions">שאלות פתוחות</a></span>
  <span class="rb-en">This site is still under rabbinic review and is not final. Do not rely on it in practice without asking a rav. <a href="/questions">Open questions</a></span>
</p>

<style is:global>
  .review-banner {
    margin: 1rem auto 0;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-align: center;
    color: #7a5600;
    background: #fbf1d8;
    border: 1px solid #ecd9a4;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .review-banner a {
    color: inherit;
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .review-banner + h1 { margin-top: 1.25rem; }
  /* The page sets <html lang>; show the matching sentence only. */
  html[lang="he"] .review-banner .rb-en { display: none; }
  html:not([lang="he"]) .review-banner .rb-he { display: none; }
</style>
